en:
"I knew you'd come.
And what it is you're wishing for right now, too.
But in the end, it's all up to you guys, okay?"{w}

{0E}"That brain plus my fortune-telling!
Even I have to admit it's the perfect plan!{0F}
Right... This time, I'm gonna win!"{w}

{0E}"...Would you kindly give it a rest?
...Could it be that you really are interested?{0F}
...Then... I do apologize..."{w}

"This is a device that measures the movements of the heavens
and gauges what kind of influence they have
on the land."{w}
